WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.140
One red letter A,
embroidered with gold thread.

2
00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:05.510
Watch it closely.

3
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.340
It never changes.

4
00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:09.190
A crowd points at it.

5
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.230
A sick figure in bed reaches towards it.

6
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.010
A man in black looks up and
sees it in the night sky.

7
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.280
Then a small girl in
crimson stands beside it,

8
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.840
exactly the same colour as the letter.

9
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:24.140
The letter stays exactly the same.

10
00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.870
So why does its meaning keep changing?

11
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.880
In this mission, you'll follow
the letter through the novel,

12
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.590
chapter by chapter.

13
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:36.010
You'll get to know Pearl, the child
her mother dresses in crimson and gold.

14
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:39.370
And you'll watch for other
symbols too: a rose-bush,

15
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.460
sunshine, a forest.

16
00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:45.320
Your mission: explain why
its meaning keeps changing.
